Drop custom agent Python files here.

Each file should contain a class that extends BaseAgent:

    from src.agents.base_agent import BaseAgent, AgentCapability, AgentResult
    from src.core.event_bus import Event, EventBus

    class MyCustomAgent(BaseAgent):
        name = "my_custom_agent"
        capability = AgentCapability.TRIAGE  # or any capability

        async def process(self, event: Event) -> AgentResult:
            # Your logic here
            return AgentResult(agent_name=self.name, action="process", success=True)

        async def run_autonomous(self) -> list[AgentResult]:
            # Your autonomous checks here
            return []

The agent will be auto-discovered and available for registration in brain.py.
